    {
      "voiceId": "zuby",
      "voiceName": "Zuby",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "If you think the government spends money wisely and that taxes should be higher, there is literally nothing stopping you from sending them extra money voluntarily.",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/ZubyMusic/status/2062514061275693350",
      "timestamp": "2026-06-04T12:37:26+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "zuby",
      "voiceName": "Zuby",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "This is true. People online love being angry, outraged, and miserable.\n\nIt sounds counterintuitive but it's undeniable.\n\n\nMarc Andreessen \ud83c\uddfa\ud83c\uddf8 (@pmarca)\n\nNothing makes people mad like good news.\n\n\n\n\u2014 https://nitter.net/pmarca/status/2062445343795712040#m",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/ZubyMusic/status/2062455163751948551",
      "timestamp": "2026-06-04T08:43:24+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "zuby",
      "voiceName": "Zuby",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "Matches my observations.\n\n\nTopher Field (@TopherField)\n\nA few observations about the US so far (caveat, I haven't left LA yet and it's only been 2 days in country, so take with a grain of salt!)\n\n1. It's not nearly as cheap as it used to be. I've been to the US 6 times in the past. Food, accommodation, transport, and clothing used to be VERY cheap here. It was expensive to get to, cheap to stay in, but now I'm pinching pennies as the pricetag on everything seems VERY high.\n\nMoney printing always",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/ZubyMusic/status/2062243653880590339",
      "timestamp": "2026-06-03T18:42:56+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "zuby",
      "voiceName": "Zuby",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "Completely abolishing the death penalty was one of Europe's biggest mistakes. \n\nI too would like to live in a fairytale version of the world where it would never be necessary, but alas, we do not.\n\nSome people are so evil and their crimes are so heinous that they need to go.",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/ZubyMusic/status/2062228440217174279",
      "timestamp": "2026-06-03T17:42:29+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "zuby",
      "voiceName": "Zuby",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "Do you understand?\n\n\nZUBY: (@ZubyMusic)\n\nBuying Twitter may end up being the most important thing Elon Musk did for humanity.\n\nAnd he's doing a lot.\n\n\n\n\u2014 https://nitter.net/ZubyMusic/status/1851504575645139061#m",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/ZubyMusic/status/2062221179646276029",
      "timestamp": "2026-06-03T17:13:38+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "zuby",
      "voiceName": "Zuby",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "I'm back in the UAE and happy to be here! \ud83c\udde6\ud83c\uddea",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/ZubyMusic/status/2062219827285278733",
      "timestamp": "2026-06-03T17:08:15+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "zuby",
      "voiceName": "Zuby",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "Thanks for the suggestions!",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/ZubyMusic/status/2061574990252617763",
      "timestamp": "2026-06-01T22:25:54+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "zuby",
      "voiceName": "Zuby",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "15 hour flight coming up. Any movie recommendations?",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/ZubyMusic/status/2061545131757433307",
      "timestamp": "2026-06-01T20:27:15+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "zuby",
      "voiceName": "Zuby",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "The past few weeks in the USA have been fun and productive. I've connected with a lot of awesome people and had a lot of great experiences.\n\nI'm looking forward to going home soon... But I will be back!\n\ud83c\uddfa\ud83c\uddf8 \ud83d\udc9c",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/ZubyMusic/status/2061539846917591145",
      "timestamp": "2026-06-01T20:06:15+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "zuby",
      "voiceName": "Zuby",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "It's been an awesome last few days at the men's retreat in Las Vegas. \n\nWhat an excellent crew. An honour to hang out and share stories and experiences. \ud83d\ude4c\ud83c\udffe",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/ZubyMusic/status/2060959537210036450",
      "timestamp": "2026-05-31T05:40:19+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "zuby",
      "voiceName": "Zuby",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "Thank God for another beautiful day. \ud83d\ude4f\ud83c\udffe",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/ZubyMusic/status/2060728505177116789",
      "timestamp": "2026-05-30T14:22:16+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
