      "voiceId": "zuby",
      "voiceName": "Zuby",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "Full interview\npiped.video/Jb8vrmM1U44?si=bYjI\u2026",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/ZubyMusic/status/2060537553967865886",
      "timestamp": "2026-05-30T01:43:30+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "zuby",
      "voiceName": "Zuby",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "'The War on Marriage'\n\nMy new interview with @NickJFreitas is out today.\n\nNow available on the Real Talk with Zuby podcast.\n\nVideo",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/ZubyMusic/status/2060497446355222973",
