    },
    {
      "voiceId": "zuby",
      "voiceName": "Zuby",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "It's easy to tell when someone forms their worldview mainly from the internet and social media rather than real world observation.\n\nThe gap between what seems true online vs what's true in reality can be immense.",
